WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:11.980
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.840
On the land with the frozen moonlight

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.670
It's rolling and drawing the line

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:40.880
The era of destruction and rebirth now begins

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.550
Heavily holding the freedom

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:48.150
Choosing the invisible path

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:55.230
Passing the sunset that's brighter than the daylight

00:00:55.230 --> 00:01:02.230
The vessel of time moves on as if telling the dream

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:11.340
There's a new dawn beyond the dark path

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:19.250
We may have been born from the arm of darkness

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:22.790
Just like being in an impossible love

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.760
We wander into the light

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:32.030
The path stretches indefinitely

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:37.490
And there's no way to go back

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:54.750
The failed attempt to make off with the Stonewall
is now known as the Battle of Miyako Bay.

00:01:55.220 --> 00:02:01.790
However, the true intent of the operation was to
kidnap Toshizo Hijikata using the Stonewall as bait.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:05.500
Hakodate Port

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:12.200
But that plan was foiled and Hijikata and
his injured comrades made it back to Hakodate.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.970
With them now is Yojiro Akizuki.

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:23.210
I must thank you, Akizuki.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:28.450
But I'm not sure if letting you accompany us
until now was the right thing or not.

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:36.290
If I need the answer to the question,
I guess this will tell me that someday.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:43.930
When that time comes, I hope we
don't have to cross swords.

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:48.570
If you'll excuse me, Hijikata-san.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:58.980
There's no god or Shogun here.

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:03.780
That's right. Now that we're enemies of the court,
this is the only place we can live.

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:06.890
Then we'd better do something big here!

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.790
Yeah, that sounds like a good idea.

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:22.200
I wonder if Yojiro has already arrived.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:25.670
Ezo, huh?

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:29.480
According to Lady Okoma,

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:35.390
building the Republic has gone surprisingly
smoothly because they're isolated by snow.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:38.720
Is this the power of the Head also?

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.830
Are you okay with hot pot?

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:45.290
We just had a really good salmon delivered to us.

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:59.000
My destiny...

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:02.240
What is the true meaning of it?

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.530
Tokyo Castle (Formerly known as Edo Castle)

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.540
It's cold.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:34.870
The leaves are starting to bud in Sunbu...
The winds of Tokyo are too cold for me.

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:41.020
But I bet you the winds in Ezo are even colder.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:44.590
You're right. Protected by
the Winter Shogun, are they?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:48.390
We're in the same position as Napoleon's army.

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:53.520
Wait for the spring... I guess
that's the only option we have.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.830
But the problem is...

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:58.460
We're not sure if the Head will wait...

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.240
Indeed.

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:08.240
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.930
Please take care.

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.390
<i>SHIN</i>

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:57.360
Hey! What are you doing?

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:02.030
Benimaru! You're so!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:10.710
What's the matter?

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:14.110
What? Yes? I was just...

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:15.240
Something happened?

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:17.070
No...

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:29.990
Looks like she's getting better.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:32.550
Hey, wait!

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:40.430
Welcome! Ladies over there,
what would you like?

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:43.310
Anything's fine. As long as it's
what you recommend, Sei.

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:45.140
Why don't you join me, Sei?

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:46.870
Hey, I was first.

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:49.250
What did you say? I was here first, too.

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:53.790
There, there, calm down. You two are among
the most beautiful girls in this city!

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:58.690
If I see your claws come out
I might have to fight you!

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:01.720
I don't mind fighting you, Sei!

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.100
Unbelievable.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:06.870
Kumakichi Yanagawa

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.130
This is the busiest it's ever been
since we opened for business.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:14.910
T-Tayu! Welcome! We've got space over here.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.530
Hey, can you scoot a little?

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:19.710
Come on, ladies!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.080
She's Tayu Kotoha, the head of
Sekkakuro in Yokohama.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.570
Do you think you can go toe-to-toe with her?

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:27.890
Stop it. I retired from that business long ago.

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:28.780
You ladies, go ahead.

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:33.490
Impressive. No wonder she's so famous.
She's said to be as good as Kiyu of Gankiro.

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:35.160
She's still very sexy.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.750
Please, come over here, Miss Kotoha!

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:42.300
I just don't get women.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:44.330
You've still got a lot to learn, pretty boy.

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:46.600
Welcome. So you're opening today...

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:49.770
Yes, finally. Thank you.

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:52.700
Are you opening a business here?

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:54.100
Yes.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:59.320
That's great! Ask me anything! I'll help you.

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:02.720
I can't believe you just said that
right in front of your employer!

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:07.180
Hey, isn't it almost time for you, too?

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:11.160
Yeah, we've picked the place and...

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:15.830
Hey, have you heard anything from the Master?

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.460
Me?

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:20.600
Why would you assume
I've heard anything from him?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.370
No, I don't mean to sound like that!

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.310
I was just... You know...

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:26.210
Here you go.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:28.840
<i>KOTOHA</i>

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:28.840
Come see me.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.950
Shogunate Remnants Army Fortress "Kita no Seki"

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.530
Just like we thought, it was easy.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.830
At the end of the day, they're outsiders.
They don't know this place like we do.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:09:01.070
They think they conquered Ezo,
but Ezo will destroy them. That's all.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:06.040
Prepare to attack! We'll head
straight for Goryokaku!

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:09.950
Charge!

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:24.900
Really? You mean those people
working at Hakodate Hospital?

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:29.230
That's right. They're that famous troupe
who performed that popular play in Yokohama.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:30.900
Sounds exciting!

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:39.540
Kakunojo
Yuyama
Croupe

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:56.730
Enemy attack!

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:08.500
Who would've thought they'd
come from the north?

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.110
We're at a disadvantage with them
attacking us from behind.

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:15.440
We must destroy them before
they start attacking us from the front.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:18.450
Assemble the entire army!

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:21.130
No, they must be trying to draw all
our attention to the north

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.990
so our defense will be weak in the front.

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:24.390
It has to be their objective.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:28.270
Diversionary tactic, huh?
There's a high possibility of that.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.230
No.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:32.290
This is not a diversionary tactic.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.740
But...

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:34.770
Then what is it?

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:39.230
But it's a strategic move... preparation
for the all-out attack in the spring.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.110
Therefore...

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:42.980
We must crush them no matter what!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:46.120
And I, Enomoto, will lead the battle!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:51.020
You can't! Should anything happen to you,
the future of the Republic will be...

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:52.020
I, Otori, will take the lead!

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:52.360
I thought I told you, Otori.
I, Otori, will take the lead!

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:54.290
I thought I told you, Otori.

00:10:55.360 --> 00:11:03.360
We'll crush them... We'll crush them
no matter what. That is MY duty!

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.370
If that's the case...

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:12.100
I'll join you, too.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:14.500
H-Hijikata! You, too?!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:54.480
To Kita no Seki?

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:56.450
Me, too?

00:11:56.890 --> 00:11:59.360
Probably he'll be there, too.

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:04.760
Now is the time to know your destiny, Leader.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.450
Kill them all!

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:26.340
Destroy them!

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:42.260
Don't withdraw! Don't withdraw!
Your comrades Enomoto and Hijikata are here!

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:48.070
What?

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:51.630
It's the chance of a lifetime!

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:53.870
We've got two important men right here!

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:56.200
Your heads are mine!

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:19.760
Moontear... Answer me! Tell me!

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.100
What is the true meaning of my destiny!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.000
Akizuki!

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:48.790
That is...

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:08.070
Don't chase him! You must reinforce the defense!
Don't let them through again!

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.590
I've been waiting for you.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.890
My comrade.

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:29.630
Now you know.

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:33.190
Master...

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:38.170
To protect your comrade Enomoto and
to dedicate yourself to building the Republic...

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:42.210
That is your destiny.

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:46.880
However, Yojiro Akizuki
hasn't figured that out yet.

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:50.780
To lead him...

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:55.690
That, too, is the destiny of Kakunojo Yuyama.

00:15:56.830 --> 00:16:02.130
I am to lead Akizuki-sama?

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:11.060
Kakunojo
Yuyama
Croupe

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.380
I won't run! I will fight!

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:30.350
If this is what he desires, I will fight!

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.220
My life!

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:46.000
For the Republic!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:05.080
My life! For the Republic!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:34.110
Gentlemen!

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:38.450
Do you know the word "world"?

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:43.760
Do you know the word "world"?

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:49.170
Do you know why the world run by the
Tokugawa, which lasted over 200 years,

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:52.230
is coming to an end?

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:57.010
Do you know the real reason?

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:02.110
It's simply because they didn't know the world!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:05.540
No... They didn't try to get to know the world!

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:17.150
They flattered and pandered to those in power,
without even thinking or feeling for themselves.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:21.870
They entrusted their lives
and their future to them!

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:28.240
This is the sin of all who live
in the Land of the Rising Sun!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:36.310
Gentlemen! What brought you all here?

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:38.340
Why are you here?

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:42.650
Why are you here?

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:50.790
You wished to separate yourselves from the men
who allowed such fools to take power!

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:53.430
Isn't that the reason?

00:19:54.900 --> 00:20:00.000
Now! Let us atone for our sins now!

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:06.810
Think for yourselves, feel for yourselves
and build for yourselves!

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.250
It's not for someone else.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:14.220
This is our nation!

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:18.020
Let us declare it to the world!

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:23.590
Let us declare that this beautiful and true nation
we love from the bottom of our hearts,

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:27.620
one of the finest in the world, exists right here!

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:48.880
For the beautiful nation that we love!

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:52.090
For the Republic!

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:55.350
I won't run away!

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.420
I will fight!

00:20:59.930 --> 00:21:02.230
Now, come with me!

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:48.740
The many emotions of these men
and women will soon collide.

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:53.310
Spring approaches. The north will soon burn.

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>AN ENCOUNTER</i>
<i>IN THE NORTH</i>

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:09.330
The hand is the sword of love

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.400
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
The dream is still an illusion

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Running on the path

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
The torn sword of love

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
At the end of it thousands of teardrops become one

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
And brighten tomorrow

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
This hand is the sword of love

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
It proves the beginning of all

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:47.970
EPISODE 23
HAKODATE IS RED

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:37.550
The Head has become the power
that shapes the new world,

00:23:37.550 --> 00:23:42.090
guiding this fledgling nation
until she is ready to emerge.

00:23:42.390 --> 00:23:46.630
And that very Head is
possessing Enomoto right now.

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:51.840
With the power of this Head, I'm sure
Goryokaku will become our solid foundation!

00:23:51.940 --> 00:23:54.940
That's nonsense! No ghost can win a war for you!

00:23:54.940 --> 00:24:00.010
We will win! Our Republic will win!
From here in Goryokaku!
